- [ ] Implement `processItem(workerIdx, item)`:
  - Call `writeFrameImpl(item.source, item.frame, item.seq)`
  - Update metrics
- [ ] Remove `start()`, `stop()`, `forceStop()` implementations
- [ ] Preserve flush thread start/stop inside `doStart()`/`doStop()`

### `HDF5WriterPerSource` + `HDF5WriterMerge`

- [ ] Verify no changes needed — they only override HDF5-layer virtuals.
- [ ] Rebuild and run tests.

